From: m <arifilabs@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 19:55:35 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] 
 3-vulkan/0001-vulkan-metal-hip-add-TurboQuant-kernel-support.patch

Conflict-resolved: S2: fa_types.glsl - kept upstream #include ggml_type_ids.glsl AND the FA_TYPE_* numeric block (fork turbo/TQ K/V ids have no upstream id; fork shader code + arifi_sync_check use FA_TYPE_*; same numbers as GGML_TYPE_*); fork case labels appended to upstream's GGML_TYPE_* switches (fa_types, flash_attn_dequant K/V); generator load_vec list gone upstream - is_arifi_mm_quant narrowed to types with a mul_mm DATA_A_ block (q2_0_g128, rocmfp4_fast); rocmfp4/rocmfpx_* never had mat-mat pipelines, their dead per-type SPIR-V is no longer compiled
Conflict-resolved: S3: flash_attn.comp - upstream kcol/vcol row index kept inside our #if !defined(DATA_A_TURBO3_0) guard (5 regions, wrap rule)
Conflict-resolved: S4 split (f172be756): pipeline_turbo_wht member re-homed into vk_device_struct in ggml-vulkan-types.h; ggml_vk_turbo_wht dispatcher kept above ggml_vk_silu_back (now non-static upstream)
